# Design

The studio is a dashboard on `#0B0A1A`. Two soft radial gradients, violet `#5B3FD6` and blue `#2B4FD8`, sit at low opacity, with a very subtle noise texture. Glass is `rgba(255,255,255,0.06)`, border `rgba(255,255,255,0.12)`, a 1px top highlight `rgba(255,255,255,0.18)`, blur 20px, saturate 140%. Use glass on at most six surfaces at once: the sidebar, the composer, the brief, the reasoning, the layers, and the tour popover.

Ink `#F4F2FF` is primary text. Secondary `#B8B3D9`. Muted `#8A84B3`. All text meets 4.5 to 1. On the accent `#8B6CFF`, text is `#0B0A1A`. The accent is for primary actions and the focus ring, with a soft glow on hover only. Success `#4FD1C5`, warning `#F5B971`, error `#FF8A8A`.

Lane hues are Drums `#FF6B57`, Chords `#F5C451`, Bass `#3FD0A8`, Melody `#6C8CFF`, and Texture `#B07CFF`. They fill that layer's card and chip. Ink on a lane is `#0B0A1A`. Full mix has no sixth hue.

Radius is 24px for large cards, 16px for inner cards, 12px for inputs, and full round for chips and pills. Instrument Sans for the interface. Instrument Serif for the greeting and for tempo and key. Sentence case. No all caps.

Focus is a 2px accent outline, offset 2px. Motion is the greeting leaving, messages arriving, brief rows filling, and layer cards appearing. Reduced motion makes those instant.

At 1440×900 the sidebar is 248px and the rail is 340px. The sidebar names Vision Studio, lists Song idea, and shows Song analyser and Song edits with a Soon pill when those flags are off. Recent ideas come from localStorage. Help and the session pill sit at the bottom. The canvas opens with "What are you feeling today?", a glass composer, quick start chips, and three how-it-works cards. After sending, the canvas is a thread and the composer stays docked. The rail holds the brief, the trace, and Build. After Build, layer cards sit in the thread and a player offers Play together and Export to Logic.

Under 1200px the rail is a tabbed panel above the composer. Under 768px the sidebar is a drawer. Record, solo and mute, full mix, the styleguide link, the demo chip, and the Soon items follow `apps/web/src/features.ts`. Layer cards and the player load lazily.
